            <div xml:id="m-e67a8e39-6bf4-4e8c-af2a-6e6555d1811d">
              <lg xml:id="m-b515f38c-1041-4df0-9ebc-48ace1e7b557">
                <l xml:id="m-80020106-c992-48e9-a928-4a038d09fcb1" facs="#m-cb0ac893-51b2-4858-866d-36a95cebd989" label="text-like">Common of Two or More Martyrs. Mass I.</l><l xml:id="m-ccd4cf3e-4c11-4267-a09b-07cd59266385" facs="#m-50ba5b03-6c45-4199-9f7c-3cd538edee84" label="ambiguous">n1es</l><l xml:id="m-81f0a290-c952-408b-bc21-7343bc8094c6" facs="#m-015334b7-6b70-4a3a-8647-df7f9489f582" label="ambiguous">ti- 6- ne,</l><l xml:id="m-be222a68-5a53-49c6-94cd-3b1d14c234d3" facs="#m-50ce85a6-a658-4866-8607-7c526809a025" label="lyrics-like">portántes * ma-ní¬</l><l xml:id="m-57e18dc6-3dda-476b-a74d-e54b995ed7a1" facs="#m-fe21cc8c-c2f7-4bd5-929d-f022ececd623" label="lyrics-like">pu-los sú¬</l><l xml:id="m-9d0bea5a-0724-4ef1-8e34-e9c9ccb91473" facs="#m-3d66335f-69f8-4dce-af63-91b690693ee7" label="ambiguous">os.</l><l xml:id="m-127c3359-6a44-4b74-8ab2-b9048a84411b" facs="#m-07bfd7a2-afe8-4ee0-9e99-b2388b3b7c80" label="ambiguous">*Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Lucam. Luc. 21. b.</l><l xml:id="m-2a0f95a8-c54a-4102-a28f-4b3ca2cfc3ed" facs="#m-cb217be2-14bf-4b71-8286-4ff5c9554c7c" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Dixit Jesus discí-meum: continget autem vobis in</l><l xml:id="m-1389279d-9cbb-4a87-af1e-94451ea3d7bf" facs="#m-d9b9875e-212a-4b4e-aa64-184bc42f5384" label="lyrics-like">L pulis suis : Cum audiéritis praé¬</l><l xml:id="m-2c5880a5-be7e-4dca-9ffa-01da4677aa97" facs="#m-8b2c4bdd-cc92-4705-b7b8-dc3b881ff60d" label="lyrics-like">testimónium. Pónite ergo in córdi¬</l><l xml:id="m-91c881f7-1993-4b4c-b163-eb4ef06454a8" facs="#m-1f630a46-fe15-43c4-811c-35c2fbf7be29" label="lyrics-like">lia et seditiónes, nolite terréri : opór¬</l><l xml:id="m-9c5c2fd2-a673-4c69-b781-c67d57639181" facs="#m-39107026-2c85-4995-b22c-3356975a81fd" label="lyrics-like">bus vestris, non praemeditári quem¬</l><l xml:id="m-487ae2ab-78c4-436b-b66b-f97fb4245822" facs="#m-f97e79c5-f206-4a01-bed8-9a27c53d6e50" label="lyrics-like">tet primum haec fíeri, sed nondum ádmodum respondeátis. Ego enim</l><l xml:id="m-c194d2eb-b0d3-4159-a3de-d645a6fd237d" facs="#m-b17a61a4-9691-4353-b0c8-86b1223b4599" label="lyrics-like">statim finis. Tunc dicébat illis: Sur¬</l><l xml:id="m-99ceded4-e39c-4acb-ae21-d87a2f62ca6d" facs="#m-f8ef959a-7777-46b8-b42c-46e7bf997036" label="lyrics-like">dabo vobis os, et sapiéntiam, cui</l><l xml:id="m-aecf3921-e51d-4b6b-9f12-fdc37b497a0c" facs="#m-815080e4-9609-4851-8061-20daba76f987" label="lyrics-like">get gens contra gentem, et regnum ]non póterunt resistere et contradi¬</l><l xml:id="m-1409c091-799c-414f-ade9-0c82dde775b5" facs="#m-fbe87340-8ef4-4705-8a62-44e259f0aa17" label="lyrics-like">advérsus regnum. Et terraemótus</l><l xml:id="m-b274178d-6c3b-4536-8340-81ae431c7770" facs="#m-24fcef8b-ffc4-4fe1-a91d-6301f6aa5e7a" label="lyrics-like">cere omnes adversárii vestri. Tra¬</l><l xml:id="m-a9c85cfe-763f-4f1b-b3c8-4e1b012c4c70" facs="#m-c3cd85ad-ffb7-422f-b4a4-7ecd5390f55c" label="lyrics-like">magni erunt per loca, et pestilén- démini autem a paréntibus, et frá¬</l><l xml:id="m-0caa9daf-0422-425f-858a-bd7e230dd24f" facs="#m-503d7c33-43aa-4316-8f1c-cb1348257565" label="lyrics-like">tiæ, et fames, terrorésque de cae¬</l><l xml:id="m-05fe0d90-9bd6-4756-ba9e-826b74fdf5d9" facs="#m-c318d55e-df59-4504-9f37-d60b7fec34ec" label="lyrics-like">tribus, et cognátis, et amícis, et</l><l xml:id="m-2e3a2594-5410-4902-b298-6b5964d9f1eb" facs="#m-fdc2648d-0963-44c7-bd8c-88e7fb784595" label="lyrics-like">lo, et signa magna erunt. Sed ante morte afficient ex vobis: et éritis</l><l xml:id="m-cc343f15-6e43-41a8-a05d-7c4d792eba25" facs="#m-120bfb68-77a2-43d0-a3b0-12687ecebd02" label="lyrics-like">haec ómnia injícient vobis manus ódio ómnibus propter nomen meum:</l><l xml:id="m-8e9c9988-0397-42b0-bb92-02d80ca93c26" facs="#m-077abafe-3091-49d9-b56e-fef0facd5f65" label="lyrics-like">et capillus de cápite vestro non</l><l xml:id="m-37369e62-b619-4761-be45-102a9b48234b" facs="#m-e2a14b03-8231-4e0a-91b0-48a1e3903bce" label="lyrics-like">suas, et persequéntur tradéntes in</l><l xml:id="m-9ad4b1d1-e397-44d8-b275-b980b3af2549" facs="#m-29eb70f3-3027-4f45-b3fe-d446203ae238" label="lyrics-like">synagógas et custódias, trahéntes peribit. In patiéntia vestra possi¬</l><l xml:id="m-949e349e-72f5-461b-9d81-c8c97529343d" facs="#m-ff7dbea2-be2d-4cab-b4f0-679205aff13c" label="lyrics-like">ad reges et praésides propter nomen ] débitis ánimas vestras.</l><l xml:id="m-845f093a-aba4-452d-9b58-14ce78038ecf" facs="#m-c6dad9e8-18d6-4e0a-a9d7-37b75b0f11e6" label="ambiguous">orrert.!</l><l xml:id="m-79124034-58bb-4747-b2bb-f31792e59d44" facs="#m-8ae77b32-00fd-4c19-aea6-8e307544cd85" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-085dc7fd-c9a1-4e08-ae98-650f0fc37b55" facs="#m-bf5c19c9-8a6a-4497-9fe8-546ca73aa793" label="lyrics-like">l1rá- bi- lis Dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-e3a7758b-5406-4c6e-aaf4-185ea9343b5f" facs="#m-58caae39-d853-44a0-af6e-e817493deebe" label="lyrics-like">us*in sán- ctis sú¬</l><l xml:id="m-57540f55-e2cd-4ca6-809c-8da39b94a950" facs="#m-157babb7-54b5-4d04-9107-fc690b888d36" label="ambiguous">bit</l><l xml:id="m-bc40eee5-e713-4c8d-aa52-4d19db74027d" facs="#m-5e3f9458-6804-4439-91a2-0c3981e5a544" label="lyrics-like">Ipse dá¬</l><l xml:id="m-d5a45587-1a6a-48e4-99d2-b13fbb08a726" facs="#m-1096bd16-3b54-4cfe-800c-5064d01f1b1b" label="lyrics-like">is: Dé-us Is- ra- el,</l><l xml:id="m-6dab81e9-13ec-4852-8df8-56676b11ea95" facs="#m-c6763a2f-7a6d-4801-b057-cb2faeb5f41a" label="ambiguous">vir¬</l><l xml:id="m-d7c2403c-981b-4558-a78b-a88217758f82" facs="#m-ef7f9760-c1e3-42e5-9674-8434e47c86a4" label="lyrics-like">plé¬ bi</l><l xml:id="m-f2e5beca-0682-4f64-a2a5-874c9a2daf42" facs="#m-dbc702c6-8c96-4aba-a88b-5520539b0d0c" label="lyrics-like">sú¬</l><l xml:id="m-cab69baf-820f-4a4b-b48f-7aaea697fdfd" facs="#m-f99845df-31fa-4941-9bef-e6b7375f6318" label="lyrics-like">tú- tem. et for- ti-tú-di- nem</l><l xml:id="m-06df5658-5169-44c0-beeb-28692461020b" facs="#m-68bf13a8-d0fb-4dca-9d0b-5406a00594e7" label="lyrics-like">benedí¬</l><l xml:id="m-3ff3d6d2-f0ca-4dea-ad53-ed1dbd1ad2ea" facs="#m-251eaf48-518a-49bd-a337-3c0c45be8b4d" label="lyrics-like">ctus Dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-ecdf0194-4a4c-44f1-980f-fa2f1b712632" facs="#m-cd2cfe4e-a698-4f7f-85e8-db365245a9ac" label="ambiguous">us</l><l xml:id="m-0fa5eb21-02d8-4b12-8991-fd9cb82895b3" facs="#m-05c671cd-403a-4a28-bc25-8782910d61a7" label="ambiguous">ae:</l><l xml:id="m-02f38611-6794-4498-b46d-abb2ae32fcd0" facs="#m-85df32bb-29b1-46f1-898b-13ba72e222d0" label="ambiguous">alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-3690469d-cd92-436e-901b-da5bf042f132" facs="#m-28fa9569-075f-40f6-aa93-498dc6ba990f" label="lyrics-like">lú¬</l><l xml:id="m-0a825509-0d49-4518-b56b-cb6190941af1" facs="#m-7f6ed4d9-947f-4fa7-b5de-3d0480aad04a" label="ambiguous">ia.</l></lg>
